&lt;p&gt;De nou bon blues al Parc Central de Nou Barris amb: Combos Escola Tallers de Blues de Barcelona, Blas Picón &amp;amp; Lluís Coloma Trío, Víctor Uris Boogie Thing i Barcelona Big Blues Band amb Myriam Swanson&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>SS "On the road" per Aragó</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2011/04/25/ss-on-the-road-per-arago/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Apr 2011 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2011/04/25/ss-on-the-road-per-arago/</guid><description>&lt;table&gt;
